  "title": "No Stopping George Attla",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-03-30\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">March 30, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/no-stopping-george-attla\">No Stopping George Attla</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/highlight\" rel=\"category tag\">highlight</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_778\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-778\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/files/attla/2012/03/2011.11.13-FNM-No-stopping-George-Comp-Small_RJ.pdf\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-778  attla-content-img\" title=\"No Stopping George Attla\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/03/nostopping.jpg\" alt=\"No Stopping George Attla\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-778\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Click on image to read article (PDF 9.9 MB)</figcaption></figure>\n<p><em>Fairbanks Daily News-Miner</em>, November 13, 2011<br>\nWith a racing career that spans from 1958 to 2011,&nbsp;George Attla embodies<span id=\"more-777\"></span>the evolution of competitive&nbsp;sprint dog mushing birthed from village Native life.&nbsp;For four decades he raced in front of the pack to earn&nbsp;every sponsorship. Today at almost 80 years old,&nbsp;George still races to win, inspiring youth to discipline&nbsp;both their minds and bodies.</p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-777\" data-postid=\"777\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-777 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    </div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
}